      "readout": "Three substantial supported posts carry a continuous tactile cap with restrained inset/arris, real empty receiver fields and visible fixing feet. It is a restrained terminal component. Its usefulness and avoidance of a detached decorative rail depend on the separately reviewed physical portal join in the combined arrangement. No glass/infill or completed safety barrier supplied.",
